# --- Publication policy --------------------------------------------------
# This repo is intended to be made PUBLIC on paper submission. Keep manuscript,
# figures, datasets, and heavy experiment outputs OUT of git from the start so
# nothing paper-related leaks when the repo goes public. Only source code and
# small reproducible verification artifacts are tracked.
paper/
manuscript/
data/
datasets/
outputs/
figures/
*.pdf
